"The {model} model in the folder {name} was verified and can now be used."
msgstr ""
"El modelo {model} de la carpeta {name} se ha verificado y ya se puede usar."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_added_file"
msgid "The {model} model in the file {name} was verified and can now be used."
msgstr ""
"El modelo {model} del archivo {name} se ha verificado y ya se puede usar."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#: client/ui/dialogs/transcription_external.py
msgctxt "transcription_external_browse_dialog_title"
msgid "Choose the folder that holds the model"
msgstr "Elige la carpeta que contiene el modelo"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_browse_file_dialog_title"
msgid "Choose the whisper.cpp model file"
msgstr "Elige el archivo del modelo de whisper.cpp"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_changed_while_checked"
msgid ""
"The files in the folder {name} changed while they were being checked, so "
"nothing was added. Try again once whatever is writing there has finished."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos de la carpeta {name} cambiaron mientras se verificaban, así que"
" no se ha añadido nada. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando termine lo que esté "
"escribiendo en ella."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_changed_while_checked_file"
msgid ""
"The file {name} changed while it was being checked, so nothing was added. "
"Try again once whatever is writing to it has finished."
msgstr ""
"El archivo {name} cambió mientras se verificaba, así que no se ha añadido "
"nada. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando termine lo que esté escribiendo en él."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_check_btn"
msgid "Verif&y"
msgstr "Veri&ficar"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_checked"
msgid ""
"The {model} model in the folder {name} was checked again and can be used."
msgstr ""
"El modelo {model} de la carpeta {name} se ha verificado de nuevo y se puede "
"usar."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_checked_file"
msgid ""
"The {model} model in the file {name} was checked again and can be used."
msgstr ""
"El modelo {model} del archivo {name} se ha verificado de nuevo y se puede "
"usar."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_custom_added"
msgid ""
"The model in the folder {name} loaded correctly and was added as a custom "
"model."
msgstr ""
"El modelo de la carpeta {name} se ha cargado correctamente y se ha añadido "
"como modelo personalizado."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_custom_added_file"
msgid ""
"The model in the file {name} loaded correctly and was added as a custom "
"model."
msgstr ""
"El modelo del archivo {name} se ha cargado correctamente y se ha añadido "
"como modelo personalizado."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_custom_checked"
msgid ""
"The custom model in the folder {name} was checked again and loaded "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"El modelo personalizado de la carpeta {name} se ha verificado de nuevo y se "
"ha cargado correctamente."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_custom_checked_file"
msgid ""
"The custom model in the file {name} was checked again and loaded correctly."
msgstr ""
"El modelo personalizado del archivo {name} se ha verificado de nuevo y se ha"
" cargado correctamente."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_digest_mismatch_question"
msgid ""
"The folder {name} has the files of the {model} model, but their contents are"
" not the ones WinZapp knows: it may be a modified or damaged copy. It cannot"
" be used as the {model} model. WinZapp can try to load it and use it as a "
"custom model instead. Do you want to try?"
msgstr ""
"La carpeta {name} tiene los archivos del modelo {model}, pero su contenido "
"no es el que WinZapp conoce: puede ser una copia modificada o dañada. No se "
"puede usar como el modelo {model}. WinZapp puede intentar cargarla y usarla "
"como modelo personalizado. ¿Quieres intentarlo?"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_digest_mismatch_question_file"
msgid ""
"The file {name} has the size of the {model} model, but its contents are not "
"the ones WinZapp knows: it may be a modified or damaged copy. It cannot be "
"used as the {model} model. WinZapp can try to load it and use it as a custom"
" model instead. Do you want to try?"
msgstr ""
"El archivo {name} tiene el tamaño del modelo {model}, pero su contenido no "
"es el que WinZapp conoce: puede ser una copia modificada o dañada. No se "
"puede usar como el modelo {model}. WinZapp puede intentar cargarlo y usarlo "
"como modelo personalizado. ¿Quieres intentarlo?"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_file_wildcard"
msgid "whisper.cpp models (*.bin)|*.bin|All files (*.*)|*.*"
msgstr "Modelos de whisper.cpp (*.bin)|*.bin|Todos los archivos (*.*)|*.*"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_find_btn"
msgid "Fi&nd..."
msgstr "&Buscar..."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_find_item_recognised"
msgid "{name} ({revision}), looks like the {model} model"
msgstr "{name} ({revision}), parece el modelo {model}"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_find_none"
msgid "No new Whisper models were found in the Hugging Face cache."
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado ningún modelo Whisper nuevo en la caché de Hugging Face."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_find_searching"
msgid "Searching the Hugging Face cache..."
msgstr "Buscando en la caché de Hugging Face..."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_forget_btn"
msgid "&Forget"
msgstr "O&lvidar"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_forget_question"
msgid ""
"Forget the model in the folder {name}? Only WinZapp's reference to it is "
"removed; the files in the folder are not touched."
msgstr ""
"¿Olvidar el modelo de la carpeta {name}? Solo se elimina la referencia de "
"WinZapp a él; los archivos de la carpeta no se tocan."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_forget_question_file"
msgid ""
"Forget the model in the file {name}? Only WinZapp's reference to it is "
"removed; the file is not touched."
msgstr ""
"¿Olvidar el modelo del archivo {name}? Solo se elimina la referencia de "
"WinZapp a él; el archivo no se toca."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_forgotten"
msgid ""
"WinZapp forgot the model in the folder {name}. The files were not touched."
msgstr ""
"WinZapp ha olvidado el modelo de la carpeta {name}. Los archivos no se han "
"tocado."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_forgotten_file"
msgid "WinZapp forgot the model in the file {name}. The file was not touched."
msgstr ""
"WinZapp ha olvidado el modelo del archivo {name}. El archivo no se ha "
"tocado."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
msgctxt "transcription_external_forgotten_reset"
msgid "The transcription model went back to Automatic."
msgstr "El modelo de transcripción ha vuelto a Automático."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#: client/ui/dialogs/transcription_external.py
msgctxt "transcription_external_label"
msgid "Model&s in other folders"
msgstr "Modelos &guardados en otras carpetas"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_load_failed"
msgid ""
"WinZapp could not load the model in the folder {name}, so it was not added."
msgstr ""
"WinZapp no ha podido cargar el modelo de la carpeta {name}, así que no se ha"
" añadido."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_load_failed_file"
msgid ""
"WinZapp could not load the model in the file {name}, so it was not added."
msgstr ""
"WinZapp no ha podido cargar el modelo del archivo {name}, así que no se ha "
"añadido."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_not_added"
msgid "Nothing was added from the folder {name}."
msgstr "No se ha añadido nada de la carpeta {name}."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_not_added_file"
msgid "Nothing was added from the file {name}."
msgstr "No se ha añadido nada del archivo {name}."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_not_identified_question"
msgid ""
"The folder {name} holds a model WinZapp can read, but not one of the models "
"it offers, so it cannot be verified. WinZapp can try to load it to see "
"whether it works, and then use it as a custom model. Do you want to try?"
msgstr ""
"La carpeta {name} contiene un modelo que WinZapp puede leer, pero que no es "
"uno de los modelos que ofrece, así que no se puede verificar. WinZapp puede "
"intentar cargarlo para ver si funciona y después usarlo como modelo "
"personalizado. ¿Quieres intentarlo?"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "transcription_external_not_identified_question_file"
msgid ""
"The file {name} is not one of the models WinZapp offers, so it cannot be "
"verified. WinZapp can try to load it with whisper.cpp to see whether it "
"works, and then use it as a custom model. Do you want to try?"
msgstr ""
"El archivo {name} no es uno de los modelos que ofrece WinZapp, así que no se"
" puede verificar. WinZapp puede intentar cargarlo con whisper.cpp para ver "
"si funciona y después usarlo como modelo personalizado. ¿Quieres intentarlo?"

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#: client/ui/dialogs/transcription_external.py
msgctxt "transcription_external_pick_prompt"
msgid "Choose the model to check and add."
msgstr "Elige el modelo que quieres verificar y añadir."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#: client/ui/dialogs/transcription_external.py
msgctxt "transcription_external_pick_title"
